{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋個別握手会だっ！た！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お洋服わぁ～......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っこんな感じ！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/09/29/6299291/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めーちゃーん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/09/29/6299291/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めーちゃーん。むちゅー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めーちゃーん（ひめたん）❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"愛未の愛を受けとってぇーやぁ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えへへ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めーちゃん大好き！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまにめんどくさいから無視するけどそれも愛❤笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい、ちゃんと全身写真のっけますね！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/09/29/6299291/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秋だからねぇ～赤チェックきとかなきゃだよね～やっぱり～。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日もすごくすごく楽しかったよ( *｀ω´)\nあっ！あと！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱりこの間の乃木どこ観た方はほとんど皆様お願いされました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ウインク...笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いいんだけどね？？いいんだけどさなんかさ恥ずかしいよぉーーーー\\(//∇//)\\\\(//∇//)\\"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな優しいから気つかって可愛いとか言ってくれるけども。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから前回のブログで皆様の暖かいコメントに心打たれました。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのままの愛未が好きと言ってくれる方がこんなにもいたなんて（；＿；）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ああありがとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は私で頑張ることにます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもたまにちょくちょく自分からウインクやってみます。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみ皆さんのことが本当に本当に大好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女の子のあみあみ族の子ですごくこった愛未のうちわを作ってきてくれる子とかいるんだけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めちゃくちゃ嬉しいんだよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日徹夜して作ったのー！！とか笑顔で言ってくれるんだけどさ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"徹夜してでも愛未に見せるために一生懸命作ってきてくれたんだって思うと、\n涙が出るほど嬉しい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うちわに限らず手紙だってプレゼントとだってなんだって本当に本当に感謝してます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は...幸せ者だ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/09/29/6299291/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちーちゃんがハート散りばめてくれた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/09/29/6299291/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んにゃ。"}],"source":"archive"}